            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/standard+model+of+cosmology"} standard model of cosmology
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/structure+formation"} structure formation
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/inhomogeneous+cosmology"} inhomogeneous cosmology
          %h2#references References
          %p
            Named after
            = succeed "," do
              %span.newWikiWord
                Alexander Friedmann
                %a{:href => "/nlab/new/Alexander+Friedmann"} ?
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Georges+Lema%C3%AEtre"} Georges Lemaître
            = succeed "," do
              %span.newWikiWord
                Howard Robertson
                %a{:href => "/nlab/new/Howard+Robertson"} ?
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Arthur+Walker"} Arthur Walker
          %p Introduction and survey:
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Matthias+Blau"}> Matthias Blau
                , chapter 33 and 34 of
                %em Lecture notes on general relativity
                (
                %a{:href => "http://www.blau.itp.unibe.ch/GRLecturenotes.html"}> web
                )
            %li
              %p
                Jorge L. Cervantes-Cota, George Smoot,
                %em Cosmology today – A brief review
                (2011)(
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/1107.1789"}> arXiv:1107.1789
                )
            %li
              %p
                Konstantinos Xenos,
                %em An Introduction to FRW Cosmology and dark energy models
                (
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2101.06135"}> arXiv:2101.06135
                )
              %blockquote
                %p
                  (emphasis on
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/dark+energy"} dark energy
                  and
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/inflation"} inflation
          %p See also:
          %ul
            %li
              Wikipedia,
              %em
                %a{:href => "http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Friedmann%E2%80%93Lema%C3%AEtre%E2%80%93Robertson%E2%80%93Walker_metric"} Friedmann–Lemaître–Robertson–Walker metric
          %p
            Discussion in
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Regge+calculus"} Regge calculus
          %ul
            %li
              Ren Tsuda, Takanori Fujiwara,
              %em Oscillating 4-Polytopal Universe in Regge Calculus
              (
              %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2011.04120"}> arXiv:2011.04120
              )
